<title>USA: Inver Grove Hgts, Minn., $1.100 mln won by Dain.</title>
<headline>Inver Grove Hgts, Minn., $1.100 mln won by Dain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $1.100 million of Inver Grove Hieghts, Minn., general obligation storm water district bonds, Series 1996 B, with a true interest cost of 5.62 percent.</p>
</text>
